Package: canvas-edge
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd (>= 247)
Description: Canvas Edge Agent and Updater
 Canvas Edge is the local execution plane for Canvas Display — a resilient
 native Rust daemon that renders scenes, controls hardware, plays media,
 and maintains offline continuity. This package provides:
  - canvas-edge-agentd: the main Edge Agent (durable local state, IPC broker,
    hardware control, content bridge)
  - canvas-edge-updaterd: the independently supervised updater (signed release
    verification, two-slot install journal, self-upgrade, rollback watchdog)
  - systemd service units for both daemons
  - dedicated non-root service users (canvas-edge-agent, canvas-edge-updater)
 .
 Architecture-specific builds are signed and verified. See
 /usr/share/doc/canvas-edge/ for release signing documentation.
